The '''2022 [[Pendle Borough Council elections|Pendle]] Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect a third of [[Pendle Borough Council]] for the [[Borough of Pendle]] in [[England]]. This was on the same day as other [[2016 United Kingdom local elections|English]] local [[election]]s. Twelve seats across ten wards were up for [[election]].

The election resulted in [[Conservative Party (UK)|the Conservatives]] maintaining control but with a reduced [[Majority favorite criterion|majority]].

